  "description": "User accounts and company-scoped role assignments (Module H). Tab Usuarios manages UserAccount rows (global role, linked person, 2FA state, status, last login) with account lifecycle actions; tab Roles por compania manages CompanyRoleAssignment grants (approver/finance/viewer with validity window). Delegation-window fields are marked pending (R2).",
  "i18n": {
    "es-EC": {
      "title": "Usuarios y roles",
      "subtitle": "Cuentas de acceso y roles por compañía del grupo"
    }
